Now update DashboardPage. Replace import and state/render parts. Could rewrite full file again. Let's carefully construct.

Imports:
```tsx
import { Fragment, useMemo, useState } from 'react';
...
import { BarraEdicao, CartoesOcultos, ControlesCartao } from '../components/dashboard/EdicaoDashboard';
import { usePreferenciasDashboard } ...
```
Remove `PersonalizarDashboard`.

State:
```tsx
const [editando, setEditando] = useState(false);
const [arrastando, setArrastando] = useState<CartaoDashboardId | null>(null);
const [alvo, setAlvo] = useState<CartaoDashboardId | null>(null);
const alternarEdicao = () => { setEditando((ativo) => !ativo); setArrastando(null); setAlvo(null); };
```
Need `CartaoDashboardId` already imported.

Header actions:
```tsx
<Button variante={editando ? 'primario' : 'secundario'} aria-pressed={editando} onClick={alternarEdicao}>
  <span className="dashboard__icone-editar" aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
  Personalizar
</Button>
```
Could JSX whitespace render "✎ Personalizar" with space. The span followed by newline text "Personalizar"; React collapses/newline? It will render no explicit space unless `{' '}`. Text whitespace in JSX around tags is often trimmed. Use `<span ...>✎</span>{' '}Personalizar`. Good.

After month picker:
```tsx
{editando ? <BarraEdicao onRestaurar={prefs.restaurar} onConcluir={alternarEdicao} /> : null}
```
Render:
```tsx
{renderizaveis.length === 0 && !editando ? (
  ...
) : renderizaveis.length > 0 ? (
  <div className="dashboard__cartoes" role="group" aria-label="Cartões do dashboard">
    {renderizaveis.map((id, indice) => {
      const classes = ['dashboard__cartao'];
      if (editando) classes.push('dashboard__cartao--editando');
      if (arrastando === id) classes.push('dashboard__cartao--arrastando');
      if (alvo === id && arrastando !== id) classes.push('dashboard__cartao--alvo');
      return (
        <div
          key={id}
          className={classes.join(' ')}
          data-cartao={id}
          draggable={editando}
          onDragStart={editando ? (e) => {
            setArrastando(id);
            setAlvo(null);
            e.dataTransfer?.setData('text/plain', id);
            if (e.dataTransfer) e.dataTransfer.effectAllowed = 'move';
          } : undefined}
          onDragOver={editando ? (e) => {
            if (!arrastando || arrastando === id) return;
            e.preventDefault();
            if (e.dataTransfer) e.dataTransfer.dropEffect = 'move';
            setAlvo(id);
          } : undefined}
          onDrop={editando ? (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            if (arrastando && arrastando !== id) prefs.moverPara(arrastando, id);
            setArrastando(null);
            setAlvo(null);
          } : undefined}
          onDragEnd={editando ? () => { setArrastando(null); setAlvo(null); } : undefined}
        >
          {editando ? (
            <ControlesCartao
              id={id}
              primeiro={indice === 0}
              ultimo={indice === renderizaveis.length - 1}
              onMover={prefs.mover}
              onOcultar={prefs.alternar}
            />
          ) : null}
          {renderizarCartao(id)}
        </div>
      );
    })}
  </div>
) : null}
{editando ? (
  <CartoesOcultos
    ids={prefs.ordem.filter((id) => prefs.ocultos.includes(id))}
    onMostrar={prefs.alternar}
  />
) : null}
```
Render hidden section even if ids empty? It would show empty section. Condition `editando && prefs.ocultos.length > 0`. Use `prefs.ocultos.length > 0`.
- If all hidden and editando, `renderizaveis.length === 0`, condition `&& !editando` false; second branch `renderizaveis.length > 0` false → null; hidden section shows all.
- If some hidden and editando, grid + hidden section.

All-hidden message:
```tsx
<p className="dashboard__texto" role="status">Todos os cartões estão ocultos. Use "Personalizar" para mostrar os que quiser ou restaure o padrão.</p>
<Button onClick={prefs.restaurar}>Restaurar padrão</Button>
```

Live region stays.

Remove PersonalizarDashboard at bottom.

Potential issue: `aria-pressed` on Button with variant; fine.

Potential issue: header button has `Nova transação` link after; order "Personalizar" then "Nova transação". The spec says beside; okay. Maybe better "Nova transação" first (primary) then Personalizar? User asked button. Existing primary action was first. We can put Personalizar first then New transaction; both. Fine.

Potential issue: all-hidden message at bottom plus hidden section in edit mode. Fine.

Potential issue: `renderizarCartao` function returns `null` for saúde unavailable; but `renderizaveis` excludes saúde when unavailable, so okay.

Potential issue: drag handle `span` inside control bar; dragging from it triggers wrapper drag. Good.

Potential issue: `draggable={editando}` on wrapper; when false, React renders `draggable="false"` attribute; CSS `[draggable='true']` only in edit. Good.

Potential issue: clicking card links in edit mode might start drag; only if moved. Fine.

Potential issue: nested interactive controls inside draggable: clicking buttons works.

Let's rewrite DashboardPage.

